                                "sense_id": "2b391b7c-18e5-3b54-88e7-8e873063c8c4",
                                "text": "I think funding sources do have an impact on the political direction of any organization. An organization that is not politically palatable to the funder is going to lose the funder. That has had an impact on the direction of the gay liberation event."
